{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Awaken</i></strong> in a fallen knight\u2019s body, claimed by a mysterious living crystal that refuses to let you die. <strong>REVENGE CRYSTAL</strong> blends challenging, deliberate combat inspired by Souls-like games with the interconnected exploration of a Metroidvania. You are not just a warrior; you are the will driving this vessel to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.poster.avif?t=1768037993\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.webm?t=1768037993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.mp4?t=1768037993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls-inspired top-down combat</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies in challenging, deliberate encounters that reward timing your dodges, blocks, and attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental crystal system</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip living crystals to infuse your sword, arrows, and spells with elemental damage, swapping elements to exploit enemy weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Metroidvania-style world</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a ruined land filled with hidden paths, shortcuts, locked doors, and optional areas that open as you gain new tools and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging boss encounters</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle powerful bosses that test your understanding of patterns, positioning, and your choice of elemental loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.poster.avif?t=1768037993\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.webm?t=1768037993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.mp4?t=1768037993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the silence of a forgotten dungeon, a knight is resurrected by a parasitic living crystal. You are a vessel without memory, driven through a ruined world by a single purpose: revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the crystal pulsing within you, you must navigate a land occupied by monstrous invaders. To uncover the truth, you must confront the ancient crimes of the Crystallen\u2014a civilization that once destroyed worlds\u2014and decide if you are here to save what remains, or finish what they started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.poster.avif?t=1768037993\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.webm?t=1768037993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.mp4?t=1768037993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","backgrou